    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44104" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sībĭlus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		1. sibilus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>hissing</i>, <i>whistling</i> (<b>poet.</b>; occurring, on account of the metre,
			only in the form sibila; cf. 1. sibilus <i>init.</i>): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">colla (colubrae),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 3, 421</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. A. 5, 277</span></i>; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ora (anguium),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 2, 211</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">coma torvae frontis (Panis),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Fl. 3, 50</span></i>
			.</div>
